{
  "key": 29702,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SharePoketchApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you a fan of the Day-Care\n",
        "Couple like me?\r",
        "I got hold of something quite useful.\r",
        "It’s the latest Pokétch app from\n",
        "the Pokétch Company.\r",
        "What’s more, they developed it in\n",
        "collaboration with the Day Care.\r",
        "Since you’re a fellow fan of the Day\n",
        "Care, I’m compelled to share this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_CheckOnDayCarePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "With that Day-Care Checker, you can\n",
        "check on the Pokémon that you’ve\f",
        "left with the Day-Care Couple.\r",
        "But I haven’t been able to leave\n",
        "my Pokémon... So here I stay..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_PokemonGrowsWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "As you travel, your Pokémon grows\n",
        "with you...\r",
        "Be always bonded in friendship.\n",
        "Pokémon Day Care"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, Trainer!\n",
        "What’s your name?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh?\n",
        "That’s a proper tootin’ name!\r",
        "Are your Pokémon in need of training?\r",
        "In that case, I’m your gal!\n",
        "Traynee, that’s me!\r",
        "Pokémon are able to improve a stat if\n",
        "they battle Pokémon that specialize\f",
        "in that stat.\r",
        "I’ve got teams of Pokémon to help\n",
        "you with all of that.\r",
        "Oh, and experience, too.\n",
        "If you just want to level up, that is.\r",
        "You just talk to me if you need any\n",
        "help! All free of charge!\r",
        "Oh! I almost forgot.\n",
        "This is a starter pack for you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeAllDone",
      "en_US": [
        "There! All done.\r",
        "Equip those items to your Pokémon to\n",
        "speed up training for a specific stat.\r",
        "Now, if you want to train, just come\n",
        "back here and chat to me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeWhatToTrain",
      "en_US": [
        "Traynee: Howdy there, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "What do you want to train today?"
      ]
    },
