      "en_US": [
        "You don’t want to train today?\n",
        "Well, never mind then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeWhatLevel",
      "en_US": [
        "Stat training? OK.\n",
        "What level of training do you want?"
