      "en_US": [
        "Brilliant!\n",
        "Let’s get this started.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeTooRough",
      "en_US": [
        "Traynee: Oh, I’m sorry!\n",
        "Was I too rough?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PokemonDayCare_Text_SovereignTrayneeFantastic",
      "en_US": [
        "Traynee: That training was fantastic!\n",
        "Come back if you need any more."
      ]
    },
